    <string name="jarnfe_audio_about_title">About jingles</string>
    <string name="jarnfe_audio_about_hint">How packs work and who hosts them</string>
    <string name="jarnfe_audio_about_body">Jingles are short audio clips shared in packs. A pack is a folder or GitHub repository with an index.json file and a jingles folder.\n\nRepositories are hosted by third parties and may contain copyrighted material. Jarngreipr does not host, verify or control their content. You are responsible for having the rights to download or use them.\n\nTo start your own, copy the template at github.com/inssekt/cocoon-jingle-repo, then add it here as username/repo-name.</string>

